QuestGuidance.Register("en",132,{
[4193]="7006C5F2\n1\tDefeat Urâshi warriors during the Dagor Carlanthir (total: 8)\030Defeat Urâshi skirmishers during the Dagor Carlanthir (total: 6)\tOrcs in service to the Utûgi charge across the battlefield during the Dagor Carlanthir.\n2\tTalk to Sirgon during the Dagor Carlanthir\tSirgon fights along the north-western bank of the river during the Dagor Carlanthir.\n",
[4194]="7002FF6B\n1\tGather bundles of wheat (total: 12)\tWheat can be found in the fields just outside Walstow.\n2\tTalk to Winsig\tHaving collected the wheat, you should return it to Winsig. Winsig can be found inside the mead-hall of Walstow.\n",
[4195]="70034A72\n1\tSearch for the Rohirrim outpost outside southern Balewood\tTBD has told you to seek out a small Rohirrim outpost to the south-west of High Knolls, near the southern border of Balewood.\n2\tTalk to TBD Scout A\tHaving found the camp, you should now speak to the captain of the Rohirrim stationed here and discover if he knows anything of the whereabouts of the refugees of Byre Tor.\n",
[4196]="7000D919\n1\tBring the ingredients to Kol\030Collect Corrupted Norboglir Leg (total: 4)\030Collect Brimstone-leech Tongue (total: 4)\tNerbyg and slugs can be found in Duvuinen, north of Gabilshathûr. Kol has asked you to collect norbog-legs and slug-tongues to help supplement the provisions at Gabilshathûr.\n",
[4197]="70060966\n1\tCollect firewood for Onora and Rúdhan (total: 5)\030Find Rúdhan's satchel\tOnora has tasked you with collecting some firewood and her husband's satchel, somewhere among the trees nearby.\n2\tBring the firewood and the satchel to Onora beside the river\tOnora is waiting by the river for you to return with the supplies you collected.\n",
[4198]="700682A5\n1\tShow your anger to Othax (/angry)\030Tell Othax of the immorality of this practice (/talk)\030Admonish Othax for this unwholesome practice (/no)\tOthax does not seem to think that there is anything wrong with taking advantage of those who suffer grievous injuries while working at Rkhatâb. You are going to give him your honest opinion of this practice.\n2\tSpeak with Othax\tYou made your displeasure with this practice known to Othax and he seems to still want to say something to you. Speak with Marjadi at the commons in Rakhatâb.\n3\tSpeak with Marjadi at the commons in Rakhatâb\tOthax was unapologetic and defensive about his decision to continue running the game. He suggested that you speak with another worker in the rest area to get her opinion. Make your way to her and let her know of your disapproval of this practice.\n",
[4199]="700334D2\n1\tTravel to Aughaire in Angmar\tAughaire is an encampment of Hillmen, north through the Ram Dúath into Angmar. The Ranger Corunir and his Hillman allies require aid to stand against the oppressive Angmarim.\n2\tTalk to Corunir at Aughaire\tAughaire is an encampment of Hillmen, north through the Ram Dúath into Angmar. The Ranger Corunir and his Hillman allies require aid to stand against the oppressive Angmarim.\n",
[4200]="70032E54\n1\tTravel to Bree\tIt is time to travel to Bree.\n2\tTalk to Second-watcher Heathstraw in Bree\tSecond-watcher Heathstraw awaits you near the Boar Fountain in Bree-town. You should speak with Second-watcher Heathstraw to learn more about Bree-town.\n",
[4201]="700334D3\n1\tTravel to Esteld‰‰ín\tEsteldín lay in the bosom of the hills on the far eastern area of the North Downs called the Kingsfell. You are to seek out a Ranger there named Daervunn.\n2\tTalk to Daervunn in Esteldín\tEsteldín lay in the bosom of the hills on the far eastern area of the North Downs called the Kingsfell. You are to seek out the Ranger there named Daervunn.\n",
[4202]="70032E57\n1\tTravel to Evendim\tOatbarton is north of Brockenborings in the Shire. You will need to follow the path through the Greenfields to reach the town and seek out Hal Gamgee. Hal Gamgee can be found near the centre of Oatbarton.\n2\tTalk to Hal Gamgee in Oatbarton\tOatbarton is north of Brockenborings in the Shire. You will need to follow the path through the Greenfields to reach the town and seek out Hal Gamgee. Hal Gamgee can be found near the centre of Oatbarton.\n",
[4203]="700334D4\n1\tTravel to Forochel\tTaur Orthon is north of Ost Forod in Evendim in the frozen land of Forochel. Mainio awaits aid outside the camp. You should find Mainio and offer your assistance.\n2\tTalk to Mainio at Taur Orthon in Forochel\tTaur Orthon is north of Ost Forod in Evendim in the frozen land of Forochel. Mainio awaits aid outside the camp. You should find Mainio and offer your assistance.\n",
[4204]="70032E55\n1\tTravel to the Lone-lands\tThe Forsaken Inn lies along the Great East Road leading out of the South-gate in Bree. If you travel for a good while, you will find the inn on the north side of the road there. You should find The Forsaken Inn and speak with the patrons there.\n2\tTalk to someone in The Forsaken Inn\tThe Forsaken Inn lies along the Great East Road leading out of the South-gate in Bree. If you travel for a good while, you will find the inn on the north side of the road there. You should find The Forsaken Inn and speak with the patrons there.\n",
[4205]="700334D5\n1\tTravel to the Misty Mountains\tGlóin's camp is west off of the road that leads up and north out of Rivendell. Seek him out and speak with him.\n2\tTalk to Glóin at his camp in the Misty Mountains\tGlóin's camp is west off of the road that leads up and north out of Rivendell. Seek him out and speak with him.\n",
[4206]="70032E56\n1\tTravel to the Trestlebridge in the North Downs\tTrestlebridge can be found north of Bree along the Greenway. You should make your way there and speak with the folk who make the beleaguered town their home.\n2\tTalk to Marla Shelton in Trestlebridge\tTrestlebridge can be found north of Bree along the Greenway. You should make your way there and speak with the folk who make the beleaguered town their home.\n",
[4207]="700334DC\n1\tTravel to the Southern Trollshaws\tEchad Candelleth in Tâl Bruinen sits atop a cliff overlooking the great river. You should seek out Candelleth there and lend her what aid you may.\n2\tTalk to Candelleth at Echad Candelleth in Tâl Bruinen\tEchad Candelleth in Tâl Bruinen sits atop a cliff overlooking the great river. You should seek out Candelleth there and lend her what aid you may.\n",
[4208]="700334E2\n1\tTravel to the Trollshaws\tScouts from Rivendell are likely encamped near the Last Bridge between the Lone-lands and the Trollshaws. You should offer them your aid.\n2\tTalk an Elf-scout in the Trollshaws\tScouts from Rivendell are likely encamped near the Last Bridge between the Lone-lands and the Trollshaws. You should offer them your aid.\n",
[4209]="7000AC50\n1\tUse Flag of the Free People\tFlags call the enemy to Tol Ascarnen facing south on the Hoardale island. Cross the river and destroy the flag located north of the southern bridge. Paashum has tasked you with a mission to destroy the flag which calls the enemy defenders to the southern bridge over the Hoardale River.\n2\tReturn to Soldier Paashum at the encampment west of Tol Ascarnen\tPaashum is at the encampment on the western bank of the Hoarwell River, west of Tol Ascarnen. You carefully sneaked to the flag calling the Free Peoples to the defence of the southern bridge and destroyed it. This set-back will surely give your forces a chance to defeat the enemy within Tol Ascarnen.\n",
[4210]="7000AC51\n1\tUse Flag of the Free People\tCross the bridge to the north-east of the camp and destroy the flag against the crumbling walls near the western shore of the Hoardale island. Paashum has tasked you with a mission to destroy the flag which calls the enemy defenders to the western bridge over the Hoardale River.\n2\tReturn to Soldier Paashum at the encampment west of Tol Ascarnen\tPaashum is at the encampment on the western bank of the Hoarwell River, west of Tol Ascarnen. You carefully sneaked to the flag calling the Free Peoples to the defence of the western bridge and destroyed it. This set-back will surely give your forces a chance to defeat the enemy within Tol Ascarnen.\n",
[4211]="7000D6B6\n1\tDefeat wights in Imlad Balchorth (total: 10)\tWights can be found in Imlad Balchorth, west of Myrkworth. Sigar has asked you to destroy the wights in Imlad Balchorth. You can find them wandering the eastern edges of Imlad Balchorth.\n2\tTalk to Sigar\tSigar is at Myrkworth, east of Imlad Balchorth. Having destroyed many of the wights as asked, return to Sigar in Myrkworth and tell him the deed is done.\n",
[4212]="70049429\n1\tWeapons can be found at Dâr Mauzur. You should collect any enemy weapons that you find in Dâr Mauzur.\t\n2\tCollect weapons in Dâr Mauzur (total: 12)\tWeapons can be found at Dâr Mauzur. You should collect any enemy weapons that you find in Dâr Mauzur.\n3\tFind a suitable place to dispose of the weapons\tYou should find a suitable place to dispose of the weapons\n4\tCompleted\tDestroyed the enemy weapons.\n",
[4213]="7001A4A1\n1\tDestroy crates of supplies at Ashúrz Maufulug (total: 6)\030Destroy weapons in Ashûrz Maufulug (total: 6)\tWeapon-racks and crates of supplies can be found in Ashúrz Maufulug, to the south and a little west of Echad Glamodúd. Glamodúd has asked you to further weaken the Orcs of Ashúrz Maufulug by destroying their weapons and supplies.\n2\tTalk to Glamodúd at Echad Glamodúd\tGlamodúd is at Echad Glamodúd, south and a little west from Ashúrz Maufulug. You should return to Ashúrz Maufulug with news of your success.\n",
[4214]="700663B1\n1\tDestroy barricades at Abedec's Watch (total: 8)\tDolvir has asked you to destroy barricades at Abadec's Watch. Abadec's Watch is located in the south-west corner of Belfalas.\n2\tTalk to Dolvir outside Abadec's Watch\tYou have destroyed many barricades in Abadec's Watch. Dolvir waits for you amongst the trees to the north of the camp. You should talk to him.\n",
[4215]="70043DF6\n1\tDestroy enemy barricades (total: 10)\tEnemy barricades can be found on the Eastern side of Osgiliath. You should destroy enemy barricades.\n2\tSpeak with Melethon\tMelethon is at the Causeway Forts. You should speak to Melethon.\n",
[4216]="70007028\n1\tDestroy drake eggs (total: 6)\tDrake-nests may be found in the western valley of Ram Dúath, north of Esteldín. You should destroy the nests of the drakes who dwell within the western valley of Ram Dúath before they can multiply.\n2\tCompleted\tYou found several drake-nests in the western Ram Dúath and destroyed them, but worms were plentiful in the area, and the nests were well-defended.\n",
[4217]="70032C38\n1\tDestroy sluice-boxes (total: 10)\tOrcs are using sluice-boxes found at the bases of the elevated tracks throughout the Redhorn Lodes, south-east of the Orc-watch.\n2\tCompleted\tOrcs are using sluice-boxes found at the bases of the elevated tracks throughout the Redhorn Lodes, south-east of the Orc-watch.\n",
[4218]="7004BEB9\n1\tDestroy watch-towers at Fushaum Bal North (total: 6)\tFushaum Bal is located in Talath Úrui. You should destroy watch-towers in Fushaum Bal North.\n2\tCompleted\tDestroyed many watch-towers at Fushaum Bal North.\n",
[4219]="70015E07\n1\tTalk to Inufileg at Gwingris\030Collect axes from the Dunlendings (total: 15)\tThe Dunlending lumber-camp is south-east of Gwingris. Inufileg is at Gwingris, west and north of the Dunlending lumber-camp Inufileg has asked you to stop the Dunlendings' wood-cutting by taking their axes from them.\n",
[4220]="7004E4F8\n1\tTalk to Tuhâl\tYou should talk to Tuhâl, who can be found in Utterby.\n2\tSabotage Jangovar spears (total: 8)\030Sabotage Jangovar bows (total: 5)\tJangovar spears and bows can be found around Utterby. You should sabotage Jangovar spears and bows.\n3\tTalk to Otkóz\tYou should talk to Otkóz, who can be found inside Utterby.\n",
[4221]="7001BAAF\n1\tAid Maenhador\030Aid Raingon\tMaenhador is at Talan Fanuidhol. Raingon is at Talan Gwilith, north-east of Talan Fanuidhol. Bahanneth has asked you to aid Maenhador and Raingon with their scouting duties.\n2\tTalk to Bahanneth at Talan Fanuidhol\tBahanneth is at Talan Fanuidhol, south-west of Talan Gwilith. You should return to Bahanneth and report your findings.\n",
[4222]="7001BAB0\n1\tScout Drûmaudhul\030Scout Bidroi Maudhul\030Scout Prakûth-fulug\030Scout Nardur-stazg\tDrûmaudhul, Prakûth-fulug, Bidroi Maudhul, and Nardur-stazg all lie to the north-west of Talan Gwilith. Raingon has asked you to scout four Orc-encampments in Fanuidhol to determine their strength: Drûmaudhul. Prakûth-fulug, Bidroi Maudhul, and Nardur-stazg. Note: While Fanuidhol Defence is active, Raingon will not be available for quest completion or comments. You will have to wait for Fanuidhol Defence to end to complete this quest.\n2\tTalk to Raingon at Talan Gwilith\tRaingon is at Talan Gwilith, south-east of Fanuidhol. You should return to Raingon with your report. Note: While Fanuidhol Defence is active, Raingon will not be available for quest completion or comments. You will have to wait for Fanuidhol Defence to end to complete this quest.\n",
[4223]="7001BAB1\n1\tScout Bolg Maufulug\030Scout Golugrak\030Scout Gazpush\030Scout Mokûrz Gundul\tAll of the Orc-encampments lie to the north of Talan Fanuidhol. Bolg Maufulug lies the furthest to the west. Golugrak is north-west of Talan Fanuidhol. Gazpush is north of Golugrak. Mokûrz Gundul is east of Gazpush. Maenhador has asked you to scout four Orc-encampments in Fanuidhol to determine their strength: Bolg Maufulug, Golugrak, Gazpush, and Mokûrz Gundul.\n2\tTalk to Maenhador at Talan Fanuidhol\tMaenhador is at Talan Fanuidhol, south of Fanuidhol. You should return to Maenhador with your report.\n",
[4224]="7002F2F5\n1\tScout the north gate of Langhold\030Scout the town's centre\030Scout the Mead Hall\tWhat remains of Langhold is not far, just a little ways south along the road in the northern Wold. You should return to Langhold and have a look around at the town that was so recently thriving -- namely the north gate, the centre of town, and the Mead Hall.\n2\tSearch for Cíllan in Harwick\tLanghold is empty, a ruin of what it once was. You should seek Cíllan and the other refugees of Langhold. They headed towards Harwick, and you should ensure that they arrived safely, and bring the grievous news to the family of the Thane.\n3\tTell Cíllan about her husband's final stand\tCíllan is in the stables of Harwick, tending to her late husband's war-steed. You should speak with Cíllan in Harwick.\n",
})
